Save-state serialization derives from the Citra Emulator Project and contributors,
including the original save-state work by Hamish Milne. Restored from Citra MMJ
revision 11b01c0a28e4441dc8902ea2ea88d9bcaf1efbc4 and adapted for Cara.
The original GPL-2.0-or-later notices remain in the source files.
Cara also rebases serialized save archive and factory host paths through the existing
user-directory placeholders so restored sessions use the current data directory.

